This is how he ends up…

1014
00:35:44,583 --> 00:35:46,083
You shut up too, Ghasem! - Yes… yes!

1015
00:35:46,416 --> 00:35:47,333
Why did you kill him?

1016
00:35:47,833 --> 00:35:49,166
I can’t say…

1017
00:35:49,208 --> 00:35:50,666
Get up, Mr. Shamsali-Mirza.

1018
00:35:50,666 --> 00:35:51,541
Get up.

1019
00:35:52,458 --> 00:35:53,666
Get up, come on!

1020
00:35:53,958 --> 00:35:54,458
Sir!

1021
00:35:55,458 --> 00:35:56,208
Sir!

1022
