1101
00:38:09,166 --> 00:38:10,041
Shir-Ali the butcher?

1102
00:38:10,041 --> 00:38:11,916
Who else but Shir-Ali the butcher?

1103
00:38:12,041 --> 00:38:13,416
I said, who is Shir-Ali the butcher?

1104
00:38:13,416 --> 00:38:14,416
Quick, fast! No one! No one Sir!

1105
00:38:14,416 --> 00:38:16,291
Shir-Ali was our neighborhood butcher,

1106
00:38:16,291 --> 00:38:17,416
Who passed away a few years ago,

1107
00:38:17,416 --> 00:38:18,541
God rest his soul.

1108
00:38:18,541 --> 00:38:19,416
You tell me. Quick, fast, swift!

1109
00:38:19,791 --> 00:38:21,291
God rest him, he was a good man, Shir-Ali!

1110
00:38:21,291 --> 00:38:21,916
Quiet!

1111
00:38:21,916 --> 00:38:22,541
He really was good!

1112
00:38:22,541 --> 00:38:25,916
How do we know you didn’t kill that poor man too!

1113
00:38:25,916 --> 00:38:27,791
Moment! Moment

1114
00:38:28,041 --> 00:38:29,291
Just killing this Dustali,

1115
00:38:29,291 --> 00:38:30,541
Is enough to last me a lifetime!

1116
00:38:30,541 --> 00:38:30,916
Quiet!

1117
00:38:30,916 --> 00:38:32,791
You quiet too! Everyone quiet! - Mr. Nayeb! Now that he’s confessed,

1118
00:38:32,791 --> 00:38:34,541
Don’t torment him anymore!

1119
00:38:35,916 --> 00:38:37,916
So now anyone who dies, Asdollah killed?

1120
00:38:37,916 --> 00:38:38,791
Mr. Asdollah-Mirza?

1121
00:38:39,041 --> 00:38:41,541
Proceed immediately to where the body is hidden.

1122
00:38:42,166 --> 00:38:43,916
No one has the right to leave the garden,

1123
00:38:43,916 --> 00:38:45,041
Until I return.

1124
00:38:47,333 --> 00:38:47,958
Aspiran?

1125
00:38:47,958 --> 00:38:48,708
Yes, Sir!

1126
00:38:48,708 --> 00:38:49,208
Handcuffs.

1127
00:38:49,208 --> 00:38:51,333
Handcuffs? Put handcuffs on your father!

1128
00:38:51,333 --> 00:38:52,958
Lady Aziz-Saltaneh!

1129
00:38:52,958 --> 00:38:53,958
You’ve worn out our patience!

1130
00:38:54,083 --> 00:38:55,083
Madam, that’s enough!

1131
00:38:55,083 --> 00:38:56,083
It’s disgraceful!

1132
00:38:56,208 --> 00:38:58,208
Oh, go on, Sir, what disgrace!

1133
00:38:58,333 --> 00:38:59,583
Should I let this damn inspector,

1134
00:38:59,583 --> 00:39:01,333
Lead this young man like a lamb to slaughter?

1135
00:39:01,333 --> 00:39:01,958
No! I’m coming too!

1136
00:39:02,083 --> 00:39:02,708
Madam!

1137
00:39:02,708 --> 00:39:04,833
Seeing a beheaded corpse,

1138
00:39:04,833 --> 00:39:05,708
Makes one’s stomach turn!

1139
00:39:05,708 --> 00:39:07,958
Is it my husband’s severed head or yours!

1140
00:39:08,208 --> 00:39:08,833
I’m coming!

1141
00:39:08,958 --> 00:39:09,708
I must come!

1142
00:39:10,083 --> 00:39:10,708
Let’s go Asdollah!

1143
00:39:11,458 --> 00:39:13,333
Don’t be afraid! I’m coming with you!

1144
00:39:14,958 --> 00:39:16,583
Don’t be afraid, my darling!

1145
00:39:17,458 --> 00:39:18,583
O Mortaza Ali…!

1146
00:39:23,958 --> 00:39:25,083
I advise you too,

1147
00:39:25,083 --> 00:39:26,708
Not to interfere,

1148
00:39:26,958 --> 00:39:27,833
With a law officer!

1149
00:39:27,958 --> 00:39:28,708
Aspiran?

1150
00:39:28,708 --> 00:39:29,208
Yes, Sir!

1151
00:39:29,208 --> 00:39:30,375
So what happened to the handcuffs?

1152
00:39:30,375 --> 00:39:32,375
This morning when we went to the office,

1153
00:39:32,375 --> 00:39:34,625
They said you’d ordered us to come here.

1154
00:39:34,625 --> 00:39:36,875
We forgot to pick them up on the way.

1155
00:39:37,000 --> 00:39:37,875
As you’ll recall,

1156
00:39:37,875 --> 00:39:39,125
Their lock was broken,

1157
00:39:39,125 --> 00:39:39,875
We sent them to be fixed.

1158
00:39:39,875 --> 00:39:41,541
You monument to stupidity!

1159
00:39:42,250 --> 00:39:44,875
I’ll have a full-length statue of you made,

1160
00:39:45,125 --> 00:39:47,000
And hung on Ghias Abad’s gate!

1161
00:39:47,125 --> 00:39:47,375
Yes, Sir!

1162
00:39:47,500 --> 00:39:48,125
Quiet!

1163
00:39:50,500 --> 00:39:51,250
Come on, let’s go!

1164
00:39:51,250 --> 00:39:52,250
Walk in front!

1165
00:39:53,750 --> 00:39:56,000
With the arrest of Asdollah-Mirza,

1166
00:39:56,250 --> 00:39:57,125
Dear Uncle began his effort,

1167
00:39:57,125 --> 00:39:59,250
To escape the trap Agha Jan,

1168
00:39:59,250 --> 00:40:01,500
Had laid for him.

1169
00:40:02,500 --> 00:40:04,375
Wherever he thought Dustali-Khan,

1170
00:40:04,375 --> 00:40:06,625
Might be hiding, he sent someone.

1171
00:40:07,125 --> 00:40:08,000
At the same time,

1172
00:40:08,250 --> 00:40:10,375
He didn’t neglect the counterattack,

1173
00:40:10,500 --> 00:40:12,375
And kept up the pharmacy boycott,

1174
00:40:12,875 --> 00:40:15,500
Hoping to force Agha Jan to retreat.

1175
00:40:16,500 --> 00:40:19,000
Both sides were sick with exhaustion.

1176
00:40:19,125 --> 00:40:19,625
But,

1177
00:40:19,875 --> 00:40:22,000
The real war was just coming to life!

1178
00:40:23,250 --> 00:40:28,625
♪ Ride of the valkyrie ♪

